ails"},{"given":"an overdue invoice whose only history row is 'failed' with reason 'mail service error'","id":"AC-12.2","level":"api","then":"latest outcome is 'failed' and the reason 'mail service error' is in the response","when":"its details are requested"},{"given":"an overdue invoice with no reminder history","id":"AC-12.3","level":"api","then":"the history is an empty list and the latest outcome is null","when":"its details are requested"}],"ears":"When an authenticated staff user requests an invoice's details, the Invoice Reminders API shall return the invoice number, customer name, amount, due date, overdue flag, days overdue, the latest reminder outcome taken from the newest history entry, and the full reminder history newest first, with each entry's sender, timestamp, outcome and failure reason.","id":"REQ-12","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-4","I-7","Q-8"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"overdue invoice INV-1042 with a billing email, and a stub email sender set to throw 'SMTP 554 rejected'","id":"AC-13.1","level":"api","then":"the response is 502 and reports outcome 'failed' with a reason containing 'SMTP 554 rejected', and a history row with outcome 'failed' and that reason is stored","when":"an authenticated staff user calls the send-reminder endpoint"},{"given":"the failed attempt in AC-13.1 has happened","id":"AC-13.2","level":"api","then":"INV-1042 is still in the overdue list with latest reminder outcome 'failed', and its details show latest outcome 'failed'","when":"the overdue list and the invoice details are requested"}],"ears":"If the email sender returns an error when a reminder is handed to it, then the Invoice Reminders API shall return an error response with outcome 'failed' and the error reason, record the attempt as failed with the sender's error message as the reason, and keep the invoice in the overdue list.","id":"REQ-13","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","Q-8","ASM-13"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"no token, and separately an expired token","id":"AC-14.1","level":"api","then":"each response is 401 with no invoice or customer data in the body, the stub email sender receives no message, and no history row is added","when":"the overdue list, invoice detail and send-reminder endpoints are called"},{"given":"a valid token for any staff user with no special role","id":"AC-14.2","level":"api","then":"none returns 401 or 403 and each succeeds (2xx)","when":"the overdue list, invoice detail and send-reminder endpoints are called for an overdue invoice with a billing email"}],"ears":"If a request to any Invoice Reminders endpoint has no valid staff authentication from the existing API, then the Invoice Reminders API shall reject it with HTTP 401 without returning invoice data, sending email or changing data.","id":"REQ-14","op":"ADDED","sources":["Q-1"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"a signed-in staff user and 3 overdue invoices for two customers","id":"AC-15.1","level":"ui","then":"the table narrows to matching rows after each filter, shows the listed columns, and every row has a 'Send reminder' button","when":"the user opens the overdue list screen, picks one customer, then picks a bucket (e.g. 7–30 or 31–60)"},{"given":"the overdue list screen is showing INV-1042","id":"AC-15.2","level":"ui","then":"the invoice detail screen for INV-1042 opens","when":"the user clicks INV-1042's invoice number"}],"ears":"The overdue list screen shall show overdue invoices in a table with invoice number, customer, amount, due date, days overdue and latest reminder outcome, plus a customer filter, a days-overdue bucket filter, a 'Send reminder' button on each row, and a link from each row's invoice number to the invoice detail screen.","id":"REQ-15","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-6","ASM-4","ASM-7"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"a signed-in staff user on the overdue list and an email sender slowed to take 5 seconds","id":"AC-16.1","level":"ui","then":"the button is disabled until the response arrives, only one history entry is created, and afterwards the button is enabled again and the new outcome is shown","when":"the user presses 'Send reminder' on a row and tries to press it again within the 5 seconds"},{"given":"the email sender is set up to fail","id":"AC-16.2","level":"ui","then":"an error message saying the send failed is shown and the invoice stays in the table with latest status 'failed'","when":"the user presses 'Send reminder'"}],"ears":"While a reminder send for an invoice is in progress, the React front end shall disable that invoice's 'Send reminder' button on the overdue list and invoice detail screens, then enable it again and show the result (sent, or the error message) once the send finishes.","id":"REQ-16","op":"ADDED","sources":["Q-5","I-4","I-6","ASM-14"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"a signed-in staff user and an overdue invoice with one failed attempt followed by one successful attempt","id":"AC-17.1","level":"ui","then":"amount, due date and both history entries are shown newest first with sender, time and outcome, the failed entry shows its reason and is marked as a failure, latest status shows 'sent', and an enabled 'Send reminder' button is shown","when":"the user opens its detail screen"},{"given":"a signed-in staff user and an invoice that is not overdue (due 2 days ago)","id":"AC-17.2","level":"ui","then":"no 'Send reminder' button is shown","when":"the user opens its detail screen"}],"ears":"The invoice detail screen shall show the invoice's number, amount, due date, reminder history newest first (sender, time, outcome and failure reason for each attempt), the latest reminder status with delivery failures marked, and a 'Send reminder' button only while the invoice is overdue.","id":"REQ-17","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-7","I-3","I-4","ASM-8","ASM-14"],"stability":1}]}}